# Artist's Talent, level 2 (ruling 2024-07-26): the total cost is the mana cost plus cost increases such as kicker, then the
# reduction is applied, and it takes off one generic mana. Kicked Burst Lightning costs {R} + {4} = {4}{R}, so {3}{R} at level 2:
# Bot1 pays it with exactly four mana (Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and Sol Ring's two) and the 4 damage of the kicked spell reaches Bot2.
# The level was reached on turn 5 with Sol Ring and the Ruby, after the Sol Ring itself was paid for with the Jet at level 1.

